BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
40. 495.8899999999999864 Td
(Patient menstrual and hormonal data is highly sensitive \(HIPAA/GDPR privacy\). Transmitting raw symptoms to a remote server creates privacy) Tj
T* (vulnerabilities and requires internet. Our custom Kotlin plugin executes pcos_rotterdam_v4.onnx on-device in under 30ms, completely offline.) Tj
